      "content": "Combining Ritalin with high doses of supplemental caffeine can significantly heighten the risk of cardiovascular side effects, such as elevated heart rate and blood pressure. Even when used sparingly, this combination increases the risk of overstimulation and potential side effects from drug interactions. It is strongly recommended that you discuss this plan with your prescribing physician to safely manage your concentration during finals.",
      "source": "target",
